Add Git to NAS. 
Generate public key on Windows side
# ssh-keygen -o

Enter, Enter, no password 
open powershell 
# cat ~/.ssh/id_rsa.pub

Copy (CTRL+C)
Open SSH Nas server 
# cd /volume1/homes/admin/.ssh    // or make dir .ssh
# vim autorized_keys

Past (CTRL+V)
Save VIM.











